### Zone Constraint (INVARIANT)
- Every node's zone MUST be drawn from the narrative's zone sequence. If the narrative only traverses ["input", "reasoning"], all tree nodes MUST use one of those zones. Do NOT assign zones the system does not have. Your tree SHOULD contain at least one node in each zone from the narrative zone_sequence where possible. Zone coverage is preferred but must not cause the tree to exceed the leaf budget. If the leaf budget is too tight for full zone coverage, prioritize the zones where the core attack mechanism operates.
